inite-dimensional real normed additive group with Borel measurable space and an additive Haar measure μ. Let F,G,W be real normed additive groups and B:F→L(G,W) a continuous bilinear map. For f:X→F, f′:X→L(X,F), g:X→G, g′:X→L(X,G) and v∈X, if x↦B(f′(x)v,g(x)), x↦B(f(x),g′(x)v), and x↦B(f(x),g(x)) are μ-integrable; f has Frechet derivative f′ on tsupport(g); and g has Frechet derivative g′ on tsupport(f), then ∫B(f(x),g′(x)v)dμ=−∫B(f′(x)v,g(x))dμ.\\\"},{\\\"op\\\":\\\"replace\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/graph/propositions/20/binders\\\",\\\"value\\\":[{\\\"symbol\\\":\\\"X\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"finite-dimensional real normed additive group\\\"},{\\\"symbol\\\":\\\"F\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"real normed additive group\\\"},{\\\"symbol\\\":\\\"G\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"real normed additive group\\\"},{\\\"symbol\\\":\\\"W\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"real normed additive group\\\"},{\\\"symbol\\\":\\\"μ\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"additive Haar measure on X\\\"},{\\\"symbol\\\":\\\"B\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"continuous bilinear map F×G→W\\\"},{\\\"symbol\\\":\\\"f\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"X→F\\\"},{\\\"symbol\\\":\\\"f′\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"X→(X→L F)\\\"},{\\\"symbol\\\":\\\"g\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"X→G\\\"},{\\\"symbol\\\":\\\"g′\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"X→(X→L G)\\\"},{\\\"symbol\\\":\\\"v\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"X\\\"}]},{\\\"op\\\":\\\"replace\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/graph/propositions/20/objects\\\",\\\"value\\\":[\\\"X\\\",\\\"F\\\",\\\"G\\\",\\\"W\\\",\\\"μ\\\",\\\"B\\\",\\\"f\\\",\\\"f′\\\",\\\"g\\\",\\\"g′\\\",\\\"v\\\"]}]}\"}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":